# Route: guide 48 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Human (1452
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.9 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 59 to 60, 44
# quests, 8.2 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Azshara, Stormwind City, Darnassus, Dun Morogh, Elwynn Forest,
# Stranglethorn Vale, Ironforge, Westfall): Southridge Beach -> Temple of
# Arkkoran -> Southridge Beach -> Stormwind City -> near Stormwind ->
# Craftsmen's Terrace -> near Craftsmen's Terrace -> Craftsmen's Terrace ->
# near Craftsmen's Terrace -> Craftsmen's Terrace -> near Craftsmen's Terrace
# -> Misty Pine Refuge -> The Grizzled Den -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Name of the Beast (3510;
# Hetaera 55); Morganth (249; Morganth 26); Message in a Bottle (630; King
# Mukla 51); An Ambassador of Evil (762; Ambassador Infernus 42).
#
# Left out: Order Must Be Restored (6187): the route takes them here but
# cannot finish them (the coverage report's missed quests).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Quell The Uprising (387), Quell the Uprising (387), The
# Color of Blood (388), The Color of Blood (388), The Stockade Riots (391),
# The Stockade Riots (391), Underground Assault (2040), Underground Assault
# (2040), Bring the Light (3636), A Green Sample (92456), A Green Sample
# (92456), Power Overwhelming (92489), Power Overwhelming (92489), In Search
# of Thaelrid (1198), Twilight Falls (1199), A Fine Mess (2904), The
# Sparklematic 5200! (2951), The Only Cure is More Green Glow (2962), The Only
# Cure is More Green Glow (2962), Hurley Blackbreath (4126), Old Ironforge
# Incursion (96393), Old Ironforge Incursion (96393), Knowledge in the Deeps
# (971), Knowledge in the Deeps (971), Mythology of the Titans (1050),
# Mythology of the Titans (1050), The Lost Tablets of Will (1139), Back to
# Uldaman (2200), Restoring the Necklace (2204), The Lost Dwarves (2398),
# Essential Artificials (2924), Essential Artificials (2924), The Grand
# Betrayal (2929), The Grand Betrayal (2929), Data Rescue (2930), Data Rescue
# (2930), Kharan Mighthammer (4341), The Fate of the Kingdom (4362), The
# Restless Dead (96394), The Restless Dead (96394), An Ancient Grudge (96395),
# Important Heirlooms (96403), Important Heirlooms (96403), The Treaty of
# Understanding (98423), The Defias Brotherhood (166), The Defias Brotherhood
# (166), The Unsent Letter (373).

